      "display_name": "OpenMOC pin-cell — ScaleNuSigmaF (k_eff increases)",
      "description": "Scaling the fuel material's nu-sigma-f cross section by factor > 1 must monotonically increase the dominant eigenvalue k_eff of the OpenMOC neutron-transport solution.",
      "mr_family": "NeutronTransport.Scaling.NuSigmaF",
      "transformation_name": "ScaleNuSigmaF",
      "assertion_type_code": "greater",
